    "description": {
      "content": "The Kion Public API provides programmatic access to manage cloud operations, governance, compliance, and financial management across AWS, Azure, GCP, and OCI. Kion is a self-hosted cloud operations platform that consolidates account provisioning, access management, compliance enforcement, and FinOps into a single interface. The API uses Bearer token authentication via Kion App API Keys and is accessible at the /api/v3/ path of your Kion instance.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Kion Support",
